From 36d86666d609519e3ab27789ea6f5f53af95f94e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: port <port@local>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 11:18:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 24/32] Direct3D layer, step 2: drawing

- xbox_ffp.vs.cg: Direct3D 8's fixed-function transform and directional lighting as an NV2A
  vertex program (50 instructions); xbox_ffp_vs.inl is its microcode from nxdk's Cg compiler
  and vp20compiler, and the layer mirrors the constant layout the compiler reported
- register combiners output the lit vertex color (textures in step 3)
- DrawIndexedPrimitive / DrawPrimitive: vertex arrays straight from the Direct3D vertex buffer
  (FVF decoded, base vertex applied), depth, alpha test, blending and color mask from render
  state, 16-bit indices sent two per word in small batches; culling off for now
- index buffers in cached memory (the CPU reads them to send indices)
- pbkit's _11.._44 macros clash with D3DMATRIX members: undefined after including pbkit
